2. TweetNaCl, C reference implementation
   Sources/CTweetNacl/tweetnacl.c
   Sources/CTweetNacl/include/tweetnacl.h
================================================================================

TweetNaCl is released into the public domain by its authors.

Vendored unchanged from https://tweetnacl.cr.yp.to/20140427/ — 809 and 272 lines
respectively, verified against those counts when vendored and again before
release.

Sources/CTweetNacl/randombytes_shim.c and its header are NOT part of TweetNaCl.
They are our own code: TweetNaCl requires the host to supply the `randombytes`
symbol, and the shim provides it together with a seam that lets Swift install the
randomness source. They are covered by this repository's Apache-2.0 license.
